    "detailed_description": "In &quot;The Tunnel&quot;, player take on the role of an unnamed soul who find himself in a place no one would ever wish to end up. Trapped within a labyrinth of tunnels, you must press forward, constantly on edge, unsure of what might be lurking around every corner. With only two companions by your side \u2013 your lantern and a pistol \u2013 survival is possible. The lantern will be your guiding light through the dark corridors, and the pistol your defense against the nightmares that haunt the tunnels.<br><br>As you climb higher, using ladders that offer a faint hope of reaching the surface, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of the story \u2013 mysterious paper notes left behind by someone else, offering cryptic hints as to how you ended up in this nightmare. But one question looms large: <strong>Can you make it out alive?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207510/extras/0cd4e95f1d37f82d7ad057b686459fc7.avif?t=1727972328\" width=610 height=318 /></span><br><br><br><i><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></i><br><br><strong>-</strong> Navigate through three floors of a complex tunnel system, filled with a haunting atmosphere.<br><br><strong>-</strong> Light the dark passages with your trusty lantern to uncover what lurks ahead.<br><br><strong>-</strong> Fight back with a pistol against lurking monsters, including zombies and demonic hounds.<br><br><strong>-</strong> Use electrical mechanisms to unlock new routes and push forward.<br><br><strong>-</strong> Seal gas leaks to clear your path and avoid deadly hazards.<br><br><strong>-</strong> Discover scattered paper notes, remnants from a previous lost soul, offering cryptic insights.<br><br><br><i>Hint: Ammo is limited, so make every shot count! </i>",
